00:00:28.685 --> 00:00:32.285
Courtney McCowan died outside Port Hardy Hospital on November 19th,

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:34.925
and her daughter, Haley Schubert, told Surrey Now Leader,

00:00:35.165 --> 00:00:39.925
a friend got her there about 10 to 11 minutes after the emergency department's daily 5pm close.

00:00:40.545 --> 00:00:44.445
Schubert said arrival was 5.11, that staff would not let her friend in,

00:00:44.785 --> 00:00:48.925
